## Assign Faculty Adviser to Internship

###############################################################

### Internship Coordinator Assign Faculty Adviser to Internship
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/internships/{{internshipId}}/adviser
Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "facultyAdviserId": "{{facultyAdviserId}}"
}
